00:00:36,833 --> 00:00:41,382
With a side branch, --graph --all draws the shape of the history:

11
00:00:41,382 --> 00:00:49,430
--all shows every branch, not only the current one; --graph draws the lines; the labels in brackets are references:

12
00:00:49,430 --> 00:00:53,699
HEAD -> main is where you are, feature-tea is another branch.

