00:01:06,700 --> 00:01:10,660
Plain git log follows only the current branch (HEAD).

18
00:01:10,660 --> 00:01:15,517
The matcha commit is on feature-tea, which main does not contain.

19
00:01:15,517 --> 00:01:18,431
When a commit seems to be missing, ask:

20
00:01:18,431 --> 00:01:22,764
