How to compare any two versions:

50
00:03:29,099 --> 00:03:36,343
your edits, what is staged, two commits, two branches; and how to read the diff format itself.

51
00:03:38,100 --> 00:03:42,499
First, a fresh practice repository for this lesson.

52
00:03:43,033 --> 00:03:48,109
