63
00:04:23,163 --> 00:04:26,680
unknown revision or path not in the working tree:

64
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:31,273
Git could not resolve the name as a commit, branch, tag or file.

65
00:04:31,273 --> 00:04:33,211
List the real branch names:

66
00:04:34,967 --> 00:04:36,766
