67
00:04:38,500 --> 00:04:39,213
Got it.

68
00:04:39,213 --> 00:04:41,965
What do I need to remember?

69
00:04:42,500 --> 00:04:47,501
git diff (unstaged), --staged (to be committed),

70
00:04:47,501 --> 00:04:54,065
HEAD (both), A B (two commits), A...B (a branch's own changes).

71
00:04:54,600 --> 00:05:02,285
Lines starting with - were removed, + added, space = unchanged context; @@ marks a hunk.

72
00:05:02,833 --> 00:05:07,698
--stat, --name-only, --word-diff and -- FILE shape the output.

73
00:05:09,433 --> 00:05:12,618
