74
00:05:13,167 --> 00:05:15,920
How to see history as what it really is:

75
00:05:15,920 --> 00:05:21,841
a graph of commits pointing to their parents, with branches as labels on some of them.

76
00:05:21,841 --> 00:05:24,526
We draw it, then build one and compare.

77
00:05:26,267 --> 00:05:30,666
First, a fresh practice repository for this lesson.

