Now merge them and draw again:

83
00:05:47,300 --> 00:05:48,649
Read it bottom-up:

84
00:05:48,649 --> 00:05:52,098
three shared commits, then the history splits.

85
00:05:52,098 --> 00:05:56,746
main has "Add opening hours", feature-tea has "Add green tea".

86
00:05:56,746 --> 00:05:58,995
Now merge them and draw again:

